.TH "Docv::Roff::Chars" "3cr" "2026-11-03" "docv 0.1.0" "docv API Reference"
.SH "NAME"
Docv::Roff::Chars \- groff special character names (\fB\%\e(xx\fR, \fB\%\e[name]\fR, \fB\%\eC\(aqname\(aq\fR) and their UTF\-8 renderings.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBrequire "docv"\fR
.sp
\fBmodule Docv::Roff::Chars\fR
.fi
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
groff special character names (\fB\%\e(xx\fR, \fB\%\e[name]\fR, \fB\%\eC\(aqname\(aq\fR) and their
UTF\-8 renderings.
.SH "CONSTANTS"
.TP 4
\fBACCENTS\fR
.RS
.PP
.RS 4
.EX
ACCENTS = {
  \(aq\e\(aq\(aq => \(aq\[u0301]\(aq,
  \(aq\(ga\(aq => \(aq\[u0300]\(aq,
  \(aq\(ha\(aq => \(aq\[u0302]\(aq,
  \(aq:\(aq => \(aq\[u0308]\(aq,
  \(aq\(ti\(aq => \(aq\[u0303]\(aq,
  \(aq,\(aq => \(aq\[u0327]\(aq,
  \(aqo\(aq => \(aq\[u030A]\(aq,
  \(aqv\(aq => \(aq\[u030C]\(aq,
  \(aq"\(aq => \(aq\[u030B]\(aq,
  \(aq\-\(aq => \(aq\[u0304]\(aq,
  \(aqu\(aq => \(aq\[u0306]\(aq,
  \(aq.\(aq => \(aq\[u0307]\(aq,
  \(aqh\(aq => \(aq\[u0328]\(aq,
}
.EE
.RE
.PP
Combining marks of the two\-character accent names (\fB\%\(aqe\fR is \[u00E9]).
.RE
