.SH "CLASS METHODS"
.TP 4
\fBdef self.[]?(name : String) : String | Nil\fR
Looks up a special character; \fB\%nil\fR for unknown names. Handles \fB\%uXXXX\fR
(with \fB\%_\fR\-joined composites), \fB\%charNNN\fR and accented letters.
